  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Reform and Transformation of MAF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Objective is to assist MAF to transform into a modern institution which is an efficient policy setter, sector regulator and service provider which operates through a process of decentralized decision-making and local, farmer-led activity planning and implementation. The IDF grant will be used by MAF to improve the planning and M&amp;E of its front-line services at the district level; to support the development of a change management plan; and to develop capacity within the national directorate for policy and planning to develop and manage major investment projects and coordinate foreign assisted or implemented projects at the sectoral level.</narrative>
  </description>
